1,Istrian Heroes of Croatian Music — Google Arts & Culture,https://artsandculture.google.com/story/5AXxPcWIHTRaJw,"Collectively, the artists are part of the ča-val, or Cha Wave, a musical genre that combines pop, rock, folk and blues music with Chakavian lyrics. The genre first became popular in the 1990s and remains so today, especially on the Istrian peninsula and the Croatian littoral.",Chakavian,Indo-European
