9,Istria on the Internet - Linguistics and Philology - Slavic Languages...,https://www.istrianet.org/istria/linguistics/slavic/chakavian/history.htm,"At the end of the 1980s in Istria there began a special subgenre of pop-rock music ""Ča-val"" (Cha wave); artists that were part of this scene used the Chakavian dialect in their lyrics, and often fused rock music with traditional Istra-Kvarner music. Recent studies.",Chakavian,Indo-European
